menu "sys_session"

    config SYS_SESSION_MAX
        int "Sessions"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
          Sessions: providers with a peer on them, a board or a client.

    config SYS_SESSION_PORTS
        int "Sub-ports of a session"
        default 4
        range 1 16
        help
          The modules one session shows in the data matrix (ATTACH's list:
          the commands, MODULE_ID_ROUTER, and the streams). Each is a port of
          the data matrix (DATA_MATRIX_PORTS).

endmenu
